WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.917
(foreign language)

00:00:06.017 --> 00:00:08.203
- Hey, how are you?

00:00:08.203 --> 00:00:09.036
(gasps)

00:00:09.036 --> 00:00:09.869
- From Egypt?

00:00:09.869 --> 00:00:10.702
- Yes.

00:00:10.702 --> 00:00:11.535
- Oh, my God!

00:00:11.535 --> 00:00:13.386
(loud ululation)

00:00:13.386 --> 00:00:14.219
Whoo!

00:00:18.941 --> 00:00:22.858
- [Waiter] Here's your
check when you're ready.

00:00:29.509 --> 00:00:31.075
- Wait, so you're an Arab?

00:00:31.075 --> 00:00:31.908
- I'm half, yeah.

00:00:31.908 --> 00:00:35.658
- Okay. Why don't you,
like, cover your hair?

00:00:44.584 --> 00:00:48.195
- So, what do you think about
the Arab-Israeli conflict?

00:00:48.195 --> 00:00:49.112
- Hi, Baba.

00:00:50.662 --> 00:00:53.495
- Baba, I told you, I am an actor.

00:00:57.591 --> 00:01:00.732
- When are you going to,
like, belly dance for me?

00:01:00.732 --> 00:01:01.565
What?

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:05.464
- Yes.

00:01:05.464 --> 00:01:06.541
- Hey, Steven.

00:01:06.541 --> 00:01:08.261
This is my friend, Ambrul.

00:01:08.261 --> 00:01:09.094
- Omro?

00:01:09.094 --> 00:01:10.740
- A-Ambrrrul.

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:13.886
- A-A-Ambrrrul.
- A-Am-Ambrrrul.

00:01:13.886 --> 00:01:15.659
- Here, I got you some snacks.

00:01:15.659 --> 00:01:16.962
Here's your tea.

00:01:16.962 --> 00:01:17.912
- Thanks. Oh, my favorite.
- Here's the cookies.

00:01:17.912 --> 00:01:19.172
- Oh wow, cookies, too.

00:01:19.172 --> 00:01:20.005
Okay, but we just ate-

00:01:20.005 --> 00:01:20.838
- Here, but, apples.

00:01:20.838 --> 00:01:25.059
No, you look so thin.
- We just ate a meal.

00:01:25.059 --> 00:01:26.997
- Hey, you're the new Arab girl!

00:01:26.997 --> 00:01:27.830
- Hi,

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:28.663
Emma, nice to meet you.

00:01:28.663 --> 00:01:29.496
- Emma?

00:01:29.496 --> 00:01:30.329
Emma?

00:01:30.329 --> 00:01:32.700
No, what's you Arabic name?

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:33.533
- Omro?

00:01:33.533 --> 00:01:35.350
- Ah-Mro.
- Eh-mro.

00:01:35.350 --> 00:01:37.043
- Yeah, exactly.

00:01:37.043 --> 00:01:38.614
From the back of your throat.

00:01:38.614 --> 00:01:40.020
Ah-mro.

00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:41.887
- That's my name - Emma.

00:01:41.887 --> 00:01:44.396
- No, like, I'm talking
about, like Mohammed.

00:01:44.396 --> 00:01:45.758
Princess Jasmine.

00:01:45.758 --> 00:01:47.441
I saw "Aladdin", I know this shit.

00:01:47.441 --> 00:01:48.274
- Umro.

00:01:49.227 --> 00:01:50.673
- You know what, Amro?

00:01:50.673 --> 00:01:51.506
- Amro!

00:01:51.506 --> 00:01:52.884
Hi, Amro nice to meet you.

00:01:52.884 --> 00:01:53.911
- Nice to meet you too.

00:01:53.911 --> 00:01:56.107
- Hey, you coming out tonight right?

00:01:56.107 --> 00:01:57.388
To the bar?
- Yeah, you coming?

00:01:57.388 --> 00:01:58.371
- Yeah, (foreign language)

00:01:58.371 --> 00:02:00.607
- You shout out? (laughs)

00:02:00.607 --> 00:02:01.954
That's what's up.

00:02:01.954 --> 00:02:04.436
Yeah...
- That means he's not coming.

00:02:04.436 --> 00:02:05.269
What?

00:02:08.239 --> 00:02:09.906
- Amro.
- Late again.

00:02:17.114 --> 00:02:18.744
- Annie, Habuti come in.

00:02:18.744 --> 00:02:21.161
I made enough for two people.

00:02:22.808 --> 00:02:25.797
Chicken, potato salad and some slaw.

00:02:25.797 --> 00:02:27.956
And oh, I have some
more stuff in the oven.

00:02:27.956 --> 00:02:32.117
But hold tight, this will tide
you over till that's ready.

00:02:32.117 --> 00:02:34.534
(Arab music)

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:41.016
(loud ululation)

00:02:41.016 --> 00:02:42.062
(laughing)

00:02:42.062 --> 00:02:44.479
- Dude, let's go grab hookah.

00:02:45.923 --> 00:02:47.287
Do you have hookah at your place?

00:02:47.287 --> 00:02:48.756
Can I come over?

00:02:48.756 --> 00:02:51.173
(Arab music)

